WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
Okay, don’t talk nonsense.

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,400
I'll take you to get everything done for you

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,280
Anyway, I brought you a charger, Brother Xiao.

4
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,680
I'll teach you how to do it. You should study hard.

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,740
How about it? Do you understand?

6
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,580
Basically understand the business

7
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,620
We can keep in touch from now on, good or bad.

8
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,020
We haven't had anything to do all morning

9
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,940
It's already past ten o'clock now. It doesn't matter.

10
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,780
I took a job at noon. What kind of job?

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:23,500
Do you give me money to be Dr. Zhu’s boyfriend? Give me a thousand to have a meal with them, Brother Xiao.

12
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,420
You really are this

13
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,780
Look, no one wants to talk to me.

14
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,820
You wait here for your order

15
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,420
You can let me know when you get the job

16
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:31,260
I'll go out with you to work again in the afternoon, okay. Then I'll leave first.

17
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,540
You came on time. Come in quickly.

18
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,780
You didn't do any work in the morning?

19
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:39,020
Go take a shower and change into new clothes

20
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:44,160
How can I take a shower without water? What's wrong? No water, okay?

21
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,600
I'll teach you how to use it and you'll see.

22
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,760
Just press here and water will come out.

23
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,800
It's cold water this way

24
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,800
Turn this way for hot water

25
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,120
You can adjust the water temperature yourself

26
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,240
Then this is your towel

27
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,200
The clothes hang here

28
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,720
You can wear it after washing it and wiping it dry.

29
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,760
Don't worry about the clothes you changed and just put them there.

30
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,280
I'll throw it in the washing machine later.

31
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,600
This is shampoo for washing hair
